"db5d251f-9e9e-504f-b646-40a0b7f52e1e" :question/problem "![](images/a7/a79b77752dd8697fe6b08f7546c3bfb09618e155e9560b82d9b5475dcd54b34c.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $b =-e$\n- **II.** $c =-d$\n- **III.** $b = e$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $b$ and $e$ have the same direction. So, $b\\neq-e$.\n- Statement II is false. The vectors $c$ and $d$ have the same direction. So, $c\\neq-d$.\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, vectors $e$ and $b$ are parallel and have the same direction. Also, the magnitude of $b$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $e$. So, $b=e$.\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504994 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096700 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "dc5bab6c-1ce7-58b5-a59d-cff2ce35ecca" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Parallel Vectors From a Diagram" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049715 :topic/id #uuid "0d3ad89a-14be-5528-a12e-4252d281243e" :topic/math-academy-id 1103 :topic/title "Parallel Vectors"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "23fe1d6f-7654-5995-b106-64328c2cefbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504868} {:answer/id #uuid "8f981ce8-25dd-5503-a038-4554372ca86a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504930}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8f981ce8-25dd-5503-a038-4554372ca86a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504930} :answer-field/id #uuid "20a0be4d-458b-508d-9994-25272f7208dc" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504866} {:answer-field/choices [{: