c =-d$\n- **III.** $b = \\frac{2}{3}e$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $b$ and $e$ have the same direction. So, $b\\neq-\\frac{2}{3}e$.\n- Statement II is false. The vectors $c$ and $d$ have the same direction. So, $c\\neq-d$.\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, vectors $e$ and $b$ are parallel and have the same direction. Also, the magnitude of $b$ is $\\frac{2}{3}$ times the magnitude of $e$. So, $b=\\frac{2}{3}e$.\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509668 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087695 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ddb59990-7419-585f-aa1b-901d59c8cfc1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Zero Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048252 :topic/id #uuid "8c876864-a853-56d6-a887-91d7f8f1cf14" :topic/math-academy-id 862 :topic/title "Zero, Square, Diagonal and Identity Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6e161a0e-393f-58cb-a973-4eeec17c7df2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509671} {:answer/id #uuid "dbe667f0-2009-50c7-90be-ba73faaf4108" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509674}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e161a0e-393f-58cb-a973-4eeec17c7df2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509671} :answer-field/id #uuid "26f49a99-533a-55f6-b257-231b7086c47d" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509666} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0975999c-0562-5ca8-9889-031815120d1f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509665} {:answer/id #uuid "2a18597b-1a12-593f-b37c-7d7d2ea9