A$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\n- $B$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, ${b}_{43}=3\\ne 0$).\n\n- $C$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $A$ and $C$ are zero matrices."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511988 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186176047 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "542df339-5020-5680-a39c-a1ae161083e7" :knowledge-point/title "Describing Properties of the Cosine Function" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049091 :topic/id #uuid "d9b41e19-22fc-5fad-93ae-b8f50010d70b" :topic/math-academy-id 3557 :topic/title "Describing Properties of the Cosine Function"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "61e3a7d8-7256-58da-815e-b8f0dda9e6b2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512020} {:answer/id #uuid "84529515-48e3-520e-bfd1-3868a9402a05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512040}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "84529515-48e3-520e-bfd1-3868a9402a05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512040} :answer-field/id #uuid "4355f151-f54d-57b7-8dcd-e52174dbc60e" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512010} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31b822ea-d79a-561e-bbe1-96f2aa290bba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511999} {:answer/id #uuid "560b4ac7-4028-5d7f-9dee-814213d524b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186512018}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "560b4ac7-4028-5d7f-9dee